19	19	# Vedeggio - Agno
20	20	# Cassarate - Pregassona
21	21	# Cuccio - Porlezza
22	22	# Laveggio - Riva San Vitale	
243	23	# Breggia - Chiasso
0      		#  timeoffset (for r-square calculation. intervals up to this parameter are not evaluated in r-square calculation. e.g. 12: first 12 intervals are neglected )
